// Title: Browser Execution In Headless Mode
// ID: ef9dcfed-690c-4c5d-a9d1-482cd422225c
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-09-12
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.stealth, attack.t1105, attack.t1564.003
// Description: Detects execution of Chromium based browser in headless mode
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\brave.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\chrome.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\msedge.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\opera.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\vivaldi.exe")) AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "--headless"))
